@page "/"
@using DeploySharpApp.Contracts
@inject DeploySharpAppService Service
<PageTitle>体验首页 · DeploySharpApp</PageTitle>

<section class="hero"><div><span class="eyebrow warm">WELCOME BACK</span><h2>选择一个能力，<br /><em>马上开始运行。</em></h2><p>统一体验视觉、语言、多模态和性能基准。后端与模型按 manifest 发现，结果、耗时和诊断证据集中呈现。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="primary" href="/vision">开始视觉推理 <span>→</span></a><a class="ghost" href="/models">查看可用后端</a></div></div><div class="hero-orbit"><div class="orbit-ring r1"></div><div class="orbit-ring r2"></div><div class="orbit-core">DS<span>2.0</span></div><div class="orbit-dot d1"></div><div class="orbit-dot d2"></div><div class="orbit-dot d3"></div></div></section>
<div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">CAPABILITIES</span><h3>四类完整工作流</h3></div><span class="muted">同一套 Application API · 三种宿主</span></div>
<div class="cap-grid"><a class="cap-card blue" href="/vision"><span class="cap-icon">◈</span><div><h4>视觉推理</h4><p>检测、分类、分割、OCR、姿态与背景移除</p></div><span class="arrow">↗</span></a><a class="cap-card purple" href="/llm"><span class="cap-icon">✦</span><div><h4>LLM / Embedding</h4><p>本地 GGUF、流式生成、对话和向量嵌入</p></div><span class="arrow">↗</span></a><a class="cap-card orange" href="/multimodal"><span class="cap-icon">▧</span><div><h4>多模态</h4><p>有序媒体、视觉语言和可取消的长任务</p></div><span class="arrow">↗</span></a><a class="cap-card green" href="/benchmark"><span class="cap-icon">⌁</span><div><h4>性能基准</h4><p>同模型、同输入、跨后端的可复核报告</p></div><span class="arrow">↗</span></a></div>
<div class="lower-grid"><div class="panel quick"><div class="panel-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">QUICK START</span><h3>三步完成一次运行</h3></div><span class="status-tag">推荐</span></div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><b>01</b><div><strong>选择模型</strong><small>从官方目录或本地文件开始</small></div><i>✓</i></div><div class="step"><b>02</b><div><strong>选择后端</strong><small>自动显示兼容性和安装状态</small></div><i>✓</i></div><div class="step"><b>03</b><div><strong>查看证据</strong><small>结果、耗时、日志一次看全</small></div><i>✓</i></div></div></div><div class="panel health"><div class="panel-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">RUNTIME HEALTH</span><h3>后端状态</h3></div><a class="text-btn" href="/models">管理 →</a></div>@foreach (var backend in Service.Backends) { <div class="health-row"><span class="health-dot @(backend.State == AppRuntimeState.Available ? "" : "warn")"></span><strong>@backend.DisplayName</strong><small>@backend.State · @backend.Version</small></div> }</div></div>
